2026-10-14 — Implemented configurable Galley Closure Review

Implemented the closure-review stage using the existing operational-form versioning, workflow APIs, defect event history, attachment authorization, and tenant/team permission model. The form is a Form Master configuration (`CLOSURE_APPROVAL / APPROVAL_REQUIRED`) with exactly two business bindings: required Closure Decision (backend options ACCEPT/DECLINE) and optional Closure Remarks (required only for DECLINE, maximum 2,000 characters). Form submission answers are not stored as generic form answers; the dedicated approval API records the decision in the existing closure approval table and append-only defect event.

